#ASSERT `failing to declare is an offence` `a person entering Singapore` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `the section 16 maximum fine` `a person entering Singapore` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the section 16 maximum fine` `an importer` EQUALS 5000

